  <item>
    <title>133. 访谈：明史学者拆解《两京十五日》背后的真实历史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af84ea03caef3b52f55a717</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af84ea03caef3b52f55a717</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>嘉宾：姚胜</span></strong></p><p><span>北京外国语大学历史学院教师，明史研究学者，著有《明代吐鲁番与"大礼议"研究》一书。</span></p><p><strong><span>小标题：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> &nbsp;借一部待播剧来聊明朝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 《明史》里那 40 个字，就是整部小说的根基</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> &nbsp;明史学者更看重的一手史料：《明实录》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> &nbsp;"不豫""大渐""驾崩"：仁宗离世前后的时间线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> &nbsp;明代嫡长子继承与明清之别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a>&nbsp; "仁"字何来：一个在位十个月的好皇帝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> &nbsp;两京制的由来：从南京到北京</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a>&nbsp; "好圣孙"：朱瞻基如何保住了父亲的太子之位</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> &nbsp;明朝其实有"双首都"：南京那套班子是干什么的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> &nbsp;玄武湖里的黄册库：全国大数据为什么放在南京</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> &nbsp;小说 vs 史实：十五天其实很从容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a> &nbsp;南京到北京怎么走：水陆两线与运河驿道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">48:08</a> &nbsp;一些必须走完的礼数</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3315">55:15</a> &nbsp;仁宣之治的分量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">56:24</a> &nbsp;宣宗的三大争议：停下西洋、撤安南、玩蟋蟀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3998">66:38</a> &nbsp;1425 是不是一个重要的年份——对照《万历十五年》</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
