  <item>
    <title>128. 访谈：3000多公里，从昆明骑车到北京去上学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa4aa84492687f6aad8a3a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa4aa84492687f6aad8a3a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 01:32:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>嘉宾：李俊辰 北外2026级新生</span></h2><h1><strong><span>小标题：</span></strong></h1><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a></span></strong><span> 欢迎北外新生李俊辰</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a></span></strong><span> 一个纳西族少年与北外之约</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a></span></strong><span> 骑行想法的萌芽：从一时冲动的种子到坚定目标</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a></span></strong><span> 出发前的准备：健身、装备、体验外卖骑手</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a></span></strong><span> 师大附中的校训精神：刚毅坚卓</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a></span></strong><span> 路线规划：昆明→贵州→湖南→湖北→河南→河北→北京</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a></span></strong><span> 装备与行李：Surlly自行车与驮包策略</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a></span></strong><span> 骑行节奏：35天、日均100公里、住宿与露营</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a></span></strong><span> 花费与饮食：日均60-100元的节俭旅行</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a></span></strong><span> 沿途风景：从云贵山区到中原平原</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a></span></strong><span> 灵活应对：台风天的及时调整</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a></span></strong><span> 坚持的理由：不想走回头路</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a></span></strong><span> 旅途中的感动瞬间：蝴蝶与小狗</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a></span></strong><span> 抵达北京：蓝牌子、安检与刷脸进北外</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a></span></strong><span> 骑行与性格：桀骜不驯的Surlly与温和的少年</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a></span></strong><span> 专业选择：孟加拉语与骑行成为生活方式</span></p><p><span>李俊辰的B站：轮上诗</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
