    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>小标题：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> 个人回忆：30年前的“7月盛夏”与暴雨赶考</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a></span></strong><strong><span> 报志愿的智慧：从“考前盲报”到父亲的手绘Excel表</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="907">15:07</a></span></strong><strong><span> 历史的转折：1977年冬季高考与不到5%的录取率</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a></span></strong><strong><span> 数据的洪流：从85%录取率到2034年1700万峰值预测</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a></span></strong><strong><span> 专业的选择：直面文科焦虑；兴趣、技术与薪酬的“三原则”</span></strong><br><br></p>]]></description>
